00:07:13,470 --> 00:07:14,010
short version.
簡短版本。

201
00:07:15,590 --> 00:07:17,250
Joey, sweetheart, you were fabulous.
喬伊，親愛的，你太棒了。

202
00:07:18,710 --> 00:07:21,850
Hey, you guys, this is my agent, Estelle.
嘿，大家，這是我的經紀人，艾斯特爾。

203
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:22,810
