Could I borrow it?
可以藉用一下嗎？

211
00:07:45,250 --> 00:07:45,690
Hi.
你好。

212
00:07:46,330 --> 00:07:46,990
Remember me?
記住帳號？

213
00:07:48,010 --> 00:07:48,950
Hi, yeah.
