00:08:00,110 --> 00:08:02,570
Could be because I don't feel like standing around all night waiting for
可能是因為我不想整夜站著等待

222
00:08:02,570 --> 00:08:04,670
some guy who may or may not scream.
某個可能會尖叫也可能不會尖叫的人。

223
00:08:05,670 --> 00:08:09,110
But Caelan, he definitely will scream.
但凱蘭，他肯定會尖叫。

224
00:08:10,410 --> 00:08:11,650
Goodbye, Ross.
再見，羅斯。

225
00:08:11,850 --> 00:08:13,090
Oh, go, bye.
噢，走吧，再見。

226
00:08:15,670 --> 00:08:17,550
Here we go, people.
我們開始吧，朋友們。

227
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:25,510
Boxing Day.
節禮日。

228
00:08:26,730 --> 00:08:28,290
The Lucille Hotel Theater.
露西爾酒店劇院。

229
00:08:30,330 --> 00:08:38,150
Joey Tribbiani gives an uneven performance about Mr. Tribbiani is not the worst
喬伊·特里比亞尼 (Joey Tribbiani) 的表現參差不齊，特里比亞尼先生並不是最差的

