這個製作中的東西。

231
00:08:39,590 --> 00:08:40,270
Yes!
是的！

232
00:08:43,610 --> 00:08:47,950
Kate Miller's awkward and mannered portrayal is laughable.
凱特米勒（Kate Miller）笨拙而彬彬有禮的形象令人發笑。

233
00:08:49,430 --> 00:08:50,730
Aha, here it is.
啊哈，就是這裡。

234
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:54,870
The Direction by Marshall Townend is...
馬歇爾湯恩德 (Marshall Townend) 的方向是…

235
