Yeah, where were you?
是啊，你在哪裡？

244
00:09:30,190 --> 00:09:31,930
Thank you for your patience.
感謝您的耐心等待。

245
00:09:32,210 --> 00:09:33,390
You're the next caller.
你就是下一個來電的人。

246
00:09:34,490 --> 00:09:36,850
You're the next caller five hours ago.
五小時前你就是下一個來電的人。

247
00:09:36,970 --> 00:09:38,310
You must be going crazy.
你一定要瘋了。

248
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:40,410
Nah, kept myself busy.
不，讓自己忙起來。

249
00:09:49,210 --> 00:09:52,110
Okay, yeah, I put your stuff in her room and her stuff in
好的，是的，我把你的東西放在她的房間，她的東西放在

250
00:09:52,110 --> 00:09:52,470
your room.
你的房間。

251
00:09:57,550 --> 00:09:58,030
Hey.
嘿。

252
00:09:59,070 --> 00:10:00,110
You okay?
你還好嗎？

253
00:10:01,690 --> 00:10:02,450
Fabulous.
太棒了。

254
00:10:02,950 --> 00:10:07,690
Listen, drama critics, they're nothing but people who couldn't make it as
聽著，戲劇評論家，他們只不過是那些無法成功的人

255
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:08,070
actors.
演員。

256
00:10:08,410 --> 00:10:09,190
You know what you should do?
你知道你該做什麼嗎？

257
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:10,350
Become a drama critic.
成為戲劇評論家。

258
00:10:15,350 --> 00:10:16,690
I'm hurt!
我受傷了！

259
00:10:19,770 --> 00:10:21,290
A plague!
一場瘟疫！

260
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:23,370
Both your houses!
都是你家的！

261
00:10:26,070 --> 00:10:29,230
By the way, he dumped me tonight after he read my review.
順便說一句，他今晚在讀了我的評論後拋棄了我。

262
00:10:30,370 --> 00:10:31,170
Oh, classy.
哦，優雅。

263
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:33,070
Yep.
是的。

264
00:10:34,250 --> 00:10:35,510
I sure know how to pick him, huh?
我當然知道怎麼選他了，是嗎？

265
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:39,950
You know, I gave up a part on the soap for this.
你知道，我為此放棄了肥皂的一部分。

266
00:10:40,450 --> 00:10:40,850
Wow.
哇。

267
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:44,570
Yeah, I, uh, I gave up a job, too.
是的，我，呃，我也放棄了工作。

268
00:10:45,230 --> 00:10:45,590
Really?
真的嗎？

269
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:45,870
What?
什麼？

270
00:10:46,550 --> 00:10:47,850
Uh, decline cats.
呃，拒絕貓。

271
00:10:50,050 --> 00:10:51,230
Hey, tell you what.
嘿，告訴你什麼。

272
00:10:51,690 --> 00:10:52,870
Let me walk you home.
讓我送你回家。

273
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:56,650
We'll stop by every newsstand and burn every copy of their Times in
我們會去每個報攤並燒掉他們的每一份《泰晤士報》

274
00:10:56,650 --> 00:10:57,090
the Post.
郵報。

275
00:10:57,770 --> 00:10:58,310
And where are the Post?
郵政在哪裡？

276
00:10:58,790 --> 00:10:59,870
You didn't see the Post?
你沒看到貼文嗎？

277
00:11:00,150 --> 00:11:00,650
No, you?
不，你呢？

278
00:11:01,410 --> 00:11:02,110
No, why?
不，為什麼？

279
00:11:09,790 --> 00:11:13,150
You really think these newspapers are just jealous of me?
你真以為這些報紙只是嫉妒我？

280
00:11:13,690 --> 00:11:14,210
Absolutely.
絕對地。

281
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:16,770
You're talented and you're good-looking.
你很有才華，而且長得又帥。

282
00:11:17,550 --> 00:11:19,830
You're sweet and cute.
你又甜又可愛。

283
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:20,430
I know.
我知道。

284
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:21,510
That's why they trashed me.
這就是他們毀掉我的原因。

285
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:23,960
Wait, wait, wait.
等等，等等，等等。

286
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:30,720
Wait a minute, wait a minute.
等一下，等一下。

287
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,300
What?
什麼？

288
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,680
I don't get you.
我不明白你的意思。

289
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:37,680
I mean, first, you hate me.
我的意思是，首先，你討厭我。

290
00:11:38,140 --> 00:11:40,180
Then, you sleep with me.
那你就陪我睡吧。

291
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,460
Then, you want nothing to do with me.
那麼，你就不想跟我有任何關係了。

292
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:44,000
Now, you want me again.
現在，你又想要我了。

293
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:46,040
What, so you never went out with an actress before?
什麼，所以你以前從未和女演員約會過？

294
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,480
Kate, do you even like me?
凱特，你喜歡我嗎？

295
00:11:53,820 --> 00:11:54,920
Of course I do.
我當然知道。

296
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:57,180
Well, so how come you blew me off?
好吧，那你怎麼把我趕走了？

297
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,960
You know, how come you were with him?
你知道嗎，你怎麼會跟他在一起？

298
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,400
I don't know.
我不知道。

299
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,780
Just, just do this.
只是，就這樣做。

300
00:12:03,900 --> 00:12:08,220
I always have to pick, like, the smartest guy or the most talented
我總是必須選擇最聰明的人或最有才華的人

301
00:12:08,220 --> 00:12:08,720
guy.
傢伙。

302
00:12:09,980 --> 00:12:11,840
Why can't I just pick someone like you?
為什麼我不能選擇像你這樣的人呢？

303
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,500
Thanks.
謝謝。

304
00:12:19,100 --> 00:12:20,320
You know what I mean.
你知道我的意思。

305
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,560
I mean, like, the sweetest guy.
我的意思是，最可愛的人。

306
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:29,220
Joe, you're just so...
喬，你真是…

307
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:32,100
You're so...
你真是…

308
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:35,160
So...
所以...

309
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:42,780
Okay, okay.
好吧，好吧。

310
00:12:45,180 --> 00:12:45,880
There we go.
我們開始吧。

311
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,560
Let's get you up there.
讓我們帶你上去吧。

312
00:12:48,180 --> 00:12:48,800
Come on.
快點。

313
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:56,300
Well, good night, Kate.
好吧，晚安，凱特。

314
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,000
Sweet dreams.
甜蜜的夢。

315
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:08,940
I'm gonna put this can right here in case you have to hurl.
我會把這個罐子放在這裡以防萬一你不得不扔。

316
00:13:16,950 --> 00:13:18,350
Please stay on the line.
請保持通話。

317
00:13:18,950 --> 00:13:20,570
Your call is very important.
您的來電非常重要。

318
00:13:22,290 --> 00:13:24,630
You've been up for 24 hours.
你已經24小時沒睡了。

319
00:13:24,830 --> 00:13:25,910
Go to sleep, honey.
去睡覺吧，親愛的。

320
00:13:26,030 --> 00:13:26,830
This isn't healthy.
這不健康。

321
00:13:27,330 --> 00:13:28,650
No, no, I'm fine.
不，不，我很好。

322
00:13:28,950 --> 00:13:29,810
And you know why?
你知道為什麼嗎？

323
00:13:30,310 --> 00:13:31,830
Because of all the riboflavin.
因為所有的核黃素。

324
00:13:34,970 --> 00:13:35,370
Hey.
嘿。

325
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:35,930
Hey.
嘿。

326
00:13:37,970 --> 00:13:39,670
Didn't you have that outfit on last night?
你昨晚沒穿那件衣服嗎？

327
00:13:39,970 --> 00:13:40,250
Yeah.
是的。

328
00:13:40,830 --> 00:13:42,750
I stayed at Kate's, but, uh, nothing happened.
我住在凱特家，但是，呃，什麼事也沒發生。

329
00:13:43,350 --> 00:13:45,770
Yeah, last time I was at Pete's, we just watched a movie.
是的，上次我在皮特家，我們剛剛看了電影。

330
00:13:47,110 --> 00:13:47,630
Of us.
我們的。

331
00:13:51,030 --> 00:13:52,170
That we'd made earlier.
是我們之前做的。

332
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:54,530
I'm sorry, I can't help it.
對不起，我無能為力。

333
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:55,630
I have a boyfriend.
我有一個男朋友。

334
00:13:57,870 --> 00:13:59,330
Hey, Phoebs, where were you?
嘿，菲布斯，你在哪裡？

335
00:13:59,830 --> 00:14:01,430
I'm so, so sorry, Joey.
我非常非常抱歉，喬伊。

336
00:14:01,570 --> 00:14:03,370
I am definitely gonna see your play.
我一定會去看你的戲的。

337
00:14:03,850 --> 00:14:06,270
I swear, your play is very important to us.
我發誓，你的表現對我們來說非常重要。

338
00:14:06,350 --> 00:14:07,350
Thank you for your patience.
感謝您的耐心等待。

339
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:09,410
Your play is the next play I'm gonna see.
你的戲就是我下一場要看的戲。

340
00:14:12,050 --> 00:14:13,130
Anyway, how'd it go with Kate?
無論如何，凱特怎麼樣？

341
00:14:13,350 --> 00:14:14,450
Oh, it was great.
哦，太棒了。

342
00:14:14,890 --> 00:14:19,010
Yeah, I walked her home, and it was amazing how much we connected,
是的，我送她回家，令人驚訝的是我們之間的連結如此緊密，

343
00:14:19,170 --> 00:14:19,470
you know?
你知道？

344
00:14:19,810 --> 00:14:21,030
Then, uh, then she passed out.
然後，呃，然後她就昏過去了。

345
00:14:21,490 --> 00:14:23,210
But then she woke up, yeah?
但後來她醒了，是嗎？

346
00:14:23,370 --> 00:14:27,410
And we stayed up all night talking, and now we're, like, totally crazy
我們整晚都在聊天，現在我們簡直瘋了

347
00:14:27,410 --> 00:14:28,250
about each other.
關於彼此。

348
00:14:28,750 --> 00:14:31,190
Joey, you had the night.
喬伊，你度過了一個夜晚。

349
00:14:31,830 --> 00:14:32,270
What?
什麼？

350
00:14:32,490 --> 00:14:35,690
Yeah, when two people finally realize their feelings for each other, and they
是的，當兩個人終於意識到彼此的感情時，他們

351
00:14:35,690 --> 00:14:38,390
talk for hours, and they learn all about the other person.
聊了幾個小時，他們就瞭解對方的一切了。

352
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:40,130
You think?
您認為？

353
00:14:40,630 --> 00:14:42,190
Did you, like, learn about her family?
你瞭解她的家庭嗎？

354
00:14:42,510 --> 00:14:43,070
Two brothers.
兩個兄弟。

355
00:14:43,150 --> 00:14:43,670
One died.
其中一人死亡。

356
00:14:43,890 --> 00:14:44,270
Yes!
是的！

357
00:14:51,430 --> 00:14:53,210
This is from the woman at the bar.
這是酒吧裡那位女士寄來的。

358
00:14:53,870 --> 00:14:54,310
Oh.
哦。

359
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:00,420
Sorry, she thought she was somebody else.
抱歉，她以為自己是別人。

360
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:05,840
What time is it?
現在是幾奌？

361
00:15:06,060 --> 00:15:06,340
1.
1.

362
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:10,100
7.15. Watch doesn't work.
7.15。手錶不起作用。

363
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:13,160
Tommy's supposed to be here soon.
湯米應該很快就會到了。

364
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,080
We're going to lunch.
我們要去吃午餐了。

365
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:20,740
Look, look, I wasn't gonna say anything to you, but...
聽著，聽著，我本來不想對你說什麼，但...

366
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:24,420
All right, I don't think you should be seeing Tommy anymore.
好吧，我認為你不應該再見到湯米了。

367
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,200
You don't?
你不這麼認為嗎？

368
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:27,700
No.
不。

369
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,100
The guy is mean.
這傢伙很卑鄙。

370
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:30,640
I mean, really mean.
我的意思是，真的。

371
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:32,460
I think you should stay away from him.
我認為你應該遠離他。

372
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:36,920
Hmm, or maybe I should stay away from all men.
嗯，或者也許我應該遠離所有男人。

373
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,780
No, it's not just because I'm jealous.
不，這不僅僅是因為我嫉妒。

374
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:43,280
I mean, I'm not, I'm not, I'm not jealous, okay?
我的意思是，我沒有，我沒有，我沒有嫉妒，好嗎？

375
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:44,420
It's...
這是...

376
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,920
Look, the guy, he screamed.
看，那個傢伙，他尖叫起來。

377
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,820
He actually screamed at this couple sitting in our seats.
他實際上對坐在我們座位上的這對夫婦尖叫。

378
00:15:49,060 --> 00:15:53,420
Yeah, and at the end of the play, he got up, you know,
